ool.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aCHTBVLmLNeU4uDDPe2QczMNSnX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCHTBVLmLNeU4uDDPe2QczMNSnX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"872967","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Toudou School's driver could be the toughest Takumi's ever faced. If Project D is to claim victory, Takumi would be wise to listen to Ryosuke's advice.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cQpKri5iHl4F686gZ3m23Ry1mxZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cQpKri5iHl4F686gZ3m23Ry1mxZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"872961","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Toudou School brings in a professional driver to face Project D in a rematch. With reputations on the line, Ryosuke must decide who will represent the team.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oqtECdFs8bJHDQ4dpCS90EZM8eF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqtECdFs8bJHDQ4dpCS90EZM8eF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"872962","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Toudou School's driver knows all about exploiting a challenger's blind spot. If Takumi hopes to win, he'll have to find a way to leave his opponent in the dark.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uOaM60ibwOk5t2nSC4YBI2QUfoK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOaM60ibwOk5t2nSC4YBI2QUfoK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"872968","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A New nightmarish opponent arrives on Mt. Akina challenging Takumi in a downhill battle. Also, Itsuki gets a new upgrade for his Eight-Five as it is demonstrated on the downhill.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bQWMaAUrJcPfoJbEmZAHI53OxNL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQWMaAUrJcPfoJbEmZAHI53OxNL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"872973","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Keisuke meets a girl named Kyoko, who happens to be a fellow FD driver. Their first encounter is pleasant and leaves her weak in the knees. Their second encounter is a race on her turf.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6VNsbrW2aejWZuDK34e2CbIPAEg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6VNsbrW2aejWZuDK34e2CbIPAEg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/8"},{"id":"872963","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hoping to keep up with Takumi's growth as a racer, Keisuke's spending most of his spare time driving. He's not interested in distractions - and that could spell heartbreak for Kyoko.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ieeRLsxIcf3oA3K5liI7viV6DXk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ieeRLsxIcf3oA3K5liI7viV6DXk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/9"},{"id":"872976","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Project D might be in trouble. The leader of the Northern Saitama Alliance has recruited a bold new driver to face Takumi. Ryosuke knows victory isn't a sure thing, and as the race begins, so does a heavy rain.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-12-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hsrFYGWMnsoIwPzEu8UfWejGEwt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hsrFYGWMnsoIwPzEu8UfWejGEwt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/10"},{"id":"872978","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi struggles to keep up with the Northern Saitama Alliance's Cappuccino. As the rain soaks the course, both teams find their confidence wavering - it seems the race could go either way.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pOjSX1UQhbuIT9BaJSkyiOLssEV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pOjSX1UQhbuIT9BaJSkyiOLssEV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"872980","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi is locked in the toughest race of his career! With Ryosuke's odd advice echoing in his mind, and the Cappuccino still leading, his decision in the last straightaway will be the difference in victory or defeat.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eXDe10hEXLmo6dVNXzrwlNDI7Rs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eXDe10hEXLmo6dVNXzrwlNDI7Rs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/12"},{"id":"872981","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Keisuke and Wataru's grueling race continues in the pouring rain. Meanwhile, the Cappuccino driver picks Takumi's brain, trying to better understand his amazing abilities behind the wheel.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rwZ96Onkeg3eCQibUGHhUlISUdk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwZ96Onkeg3eCQibUGHhUlISUdk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/13"},{"id":"872982","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After driving the Impreza, Takumi begins to question his abilities behind the wheel of the Eight-Six. Itsuki's got his own emotional turmoil after a date with Kasumi takes an unexpected turn.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vppfesPuRiGZyFbSpwXmEG5vy4I.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vppfesPuRiGZyFbSpwXmEG5vy4I.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/14"},{"id":"872964","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi continues wrestling with the differences in his Eight-Six and the Impreza. Later, when Keisuke falls prey to a trap set by Project D's next opponents, the upcoming race could be over before it begins.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7qOrxTrK2fw5gQc8bjpzDRzkHMf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7qOrxTrK2fw5gQc8bjpzDRzkHMf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/15"},{"id":"872966","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The damage to Keisuke's car might prevent him from driving in the uphill race. Just as it looks like he's out of options, Kyoko arrives on the scene in her FD.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dJSmbT6120cYQEEIH6rRujtHWL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6dJSmbT6120cYQEEIH6rRujtHWL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/16"},{"id":"872969","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Lan EVO drivers have proven to be Project D's shadiest opponents yet. They've already shown their willingness to cheat - and now they've threatened Takumi's team with physical violence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eb865XDCF5Kz7V9JgmmWoyE2RHp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eb865XDCF5Kz7V9JgmmWoyE2RHp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/17"},{"id":"872970","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyoko is delighted to spend a day with Keisuke while his car's in the shop. She likes him more than ever, but with his skills growing, Keisuke's never been more focused on driving.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qIfdG3xhGJWRdohsYF5Fc4WwuNE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qIfdG3xhGJWRdohsYF5Fc4WwuNE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/18"},{"id":"872971","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Project D's next match is against a pair of legendary racers. The veteran drivers of Purple Shadow may be a lot older than Takumi's crew, but they aren't rusty. In fact, their skills are as sharp as polished blades.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v4rmaXWqqX807qChqh6fyz9Dszc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v4rmaXWqqX807qChqh6fyz9Dszc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/19"},{"id":"872972","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Keisuke climbs behind the wheel of his newly modified FD to take on the legendary God Foot's GT-R! The race will be tougher - and longer - than normal. Luckily, Ryosuke's got a plan.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jb09wopnFkPtxWjELG7PagvTYXa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jb09wopnFkPtxWjELG7PagvTYXa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/20"},{"id":"872974","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battle between the FD and GT-R continues, however the real battle has just begun. Now, Hoshino demonstrates his unique driving skills that people call the impossible earning him the name Godfoot. This makes Keisuke’s true racing abilities appear when it’s pushed beyond his limits as both drivers begin to drive recklessly forcing the battle to be settled in more than just one battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b53I7srzkfsQH6N3qlpDZUzo9Q7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b53I7srzkfsQH6N3qlpDZUzo9Q7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/21"},{"id":"872975","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"God Arm's unexpected moves and legendary steering skills have Project D's downhill ace feeling the pressure - and it doesn't help that Takumi's mind keeps drifting back to the Impreza.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oxyUGAWp0HqZapwUS71C5TlNM82.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oxyUGAWp0HqZapwUS71C5TlNM82.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/22"},{"id":"872977","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi's greatest strength is his greatest weakness in the match with God Arm. The race has become an endurance test, and both drivers are wearing thin. Something's got to give - and soon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kN8LfIVH7K9S2dgNfjJ8gbQvjMK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kN8LfIVH7K9S2dgNfjJ8gbQvjMK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/23"},{"id":"872979","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi and God Arm speed toward the finish line. After the race ends, the rising star looks to the legend for a lesson in technique - and Project D looks into the future where new challengers wait for their shot.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-10-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zvuzzzKNU07ukKri0hqCfROHXdh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zvuzzzKNU07ukKri0hqCfROHXdh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3/episode/24"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/40424/season/3"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793428137091,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
